Persistent GitHub Actions Runner Lifecycle Reference
Copyright 2026 Lightmeter Ltd

This repository is a source-only, sanitized reference derived from a retired
internal runner lifecycle system developed at Lightmeter. The published source
was substantially adapted to remove deployment-specific identifiers and the
privileged host backend.

The broader operating history included GitLab Runner and GitHub Actions. The
code in this snapshot models the later GitHub Actions lifecycle controller and
does not include a GitLab adapter.
